@MartinSLewis No abuse, but you must differentiate bitcoin from crypto.

BTC is the original, fixed-supply, decentralised money network. 

Crypto includes everything else too: Ethereum, stablecoins, DeFi, NFTs, tokens, apps, and plenty of other nonsense.

